<div style="text-align: right;"><div class="page-rate-widget-box"><span class="rate-points">rating:&nbsp;<span class="number prw54353">+132</span></span><span class="rateup btn btn-default"><a title="I like it" href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.modules.PageRateWidgetModule.listeners.rate(event, 1)">+</a></span><span class="ratedown btn btn-default"><a title="I don't like it" href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.modules.PageRateWidgetModule.listeners.rate(event, -1)">&#8211;</a></span><span class="cancel btn btn-default"><a title="Cancel my vote" href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.modules.PageRateWidgetModule.listeners.cancelVote(event)">x</a></span></div></div>
<p>SkipOS is an new operating system developed by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3781861); return false;"><img class="small" src="https://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1781455785" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(https://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3781861); return false;">EstrellaYoshte</a></span> to supersede the outdated DotSystem as part of a Foundation-wide transition phase led by the Infotech Department.</p>
<p>To install it on your existing Foundation-issued devices, input the following command in the terminal:</p>
<div class="skip_box terminal">
<p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[include&#32;:scp-wiki:theme:bedrock]]</span><br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[include&#32;:scp-wiki:theme:skipos]]</span></p>
</div>
<p>To change local time or the wallpaper, input the following command:</p>
<div class="skip_box terminal">
<p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[module&#32;CSS]]</span><br />
:root {<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;--desktop-time:&#32;'12:30';</span><br />
